        },
        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Scylladon is covered in the trophies of its past kills, and thick shipwreck armor covers many of its weak points. Scylladon and her tentacles have Construct Armor until damaged by a critical hit or falling below 50% health. Use the Construct Armour active toggle to turn it on.</p><p>Scylladon and her tentacles also have Hardness 8 as long as Construct Armor is active. To enable it, add the Construct trait to Scylladon and all tentacles, set the Hardness stat to 8, and remove the Construct trait.</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
